# Agent Instructions — Dashboard Surface

Surface role: **Operator/Admin panel (Web)**
Transport: **HTTP Gateway only**

## Surface Contract

See: `../../../openspec/specs/client-surfaces/surface-contracts/web-dashboard.md`

## Key Constraints

- **Transport**: Dashboard MUST use HTTP Gateway API only
- **No direct runtime access**: All operations go through gateway
- **Admin scope**: Config, sessions, memory, audit only

## Current Status

This surface is **complete** — implements all mandatory capabilities.

## Mandatory Capabilities

- [x] Runtime configuration via `GET/PUT /web/admin/config`
- [x] Session monitoring
- [x] Memory administration
- [x] MCP server configuration
- [x] Audit log viewing
- [x] Options catalog via `GET /web/admin/options`

## Security Notes

- Bearer token required for all admin endpoints
- Pairing flow for token acquisition
- No direct config.toml modification
- Restart-required fields detection
